WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:05.008
Gildong and the Hwalbindang were in a village by the sea.

2
00:00:05.009 --> 00:00:11.362
They were handing out grain.

3
00:00:11.363 --> 00:00:16.576
A sign caught Gildong's eye.

4
00:00:16.577 --> 00:00:20.511
He laughed as he read it.

5
00:00:20.512 --> 00:00:23.885
"What's so funny?" Nabi asked.

6
00:00:23.886 --> 00:00:27.669
"I'm the new minister of war," Gildong said.

7
00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:31.475
"The king is ordering me to come to the palace."

8
00:00:31.476 --> 00:00:36.077
Mok scratched his head. "Why is that funny?"

9
00:00:36.078 --> 00:00:39.882
"The king's still trying to capture me," Gildong said.

10
00:00:39.883 --> 00:00:43.549
"I guess he'll never give up."

11
00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:49.482
"What will you do?" Chibong asked.

12
00:00:49.483 --> 00:00:52.704
Gildong looked out across the sea.

13
00:00:52.705 --> 00:00:55.227
"I think it's time for a new adventure.

14
00:00:55.228 --> 00:00:58.667
But first I am going to the palace."

15
00:00:58.668 --> 00:01:01.969
"What?" Mok gulped.

16
00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:06.440
"You can't go, boss. It's not safe."

17
00:01:06.441 --> 00:01:09.262
"I'll be fine," Gildong said.

18
00:01:09.263 --> 00:01:16.259
"I must see the king and end this once and for all."

19
00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:20.727
He gathered everyone closer.

20
00:01:20.728 --> 00:01:31.340
"Here is what you must do while I'm gone . . ."

21
00:01:31.341 --> 00:01:36.106
*** At the palace Gildong entered the

22
00:01:36.107 --> 00:01:43.997
courtyard. "Your Majesty." Gildong

23
00:01:43.998 --> 00:01:49.946
bowed. "I am lowborn, yet you want me as your minister of war. I'm

24
00:01:49.947 --> 00:01:54.953
honored." Heup grinned. "Now!" he

25
00:01:54.954 --> 00:01:59.128
yelled. Soldiers ran in and surrounded

26
00:01:59.129 --> 00:02:02.216
Gildong. Their spears moved in

27
00:02:02.217 --> 00:02:09.409
fast. But Gildong reached for his fan.

28
00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:13.557
"Fly!" "Where did he go?" the king

29
00:02:13.558 --> 00:02:16.115
cried. Gildong stood high above.

30
00:02:16.116 --> 00:02:23.919
He laughed as everyone below looked for him. "Up here!"

31
00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:26.691
The crowd looked up.

32
00:02:26.692 --> 00:02:31.239
"Your Majesty is very generous to make me a minister," Gildong said.

33
00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:33.344
"But I'm going to refuse the position.

34
00:02:33.345 --> 00:02:36.211
You'll be rid of me at last."

35
00:02:36.212 --> 00:02:40.630
"What?" The king looked shocked.

36
00:02:40.631 --> 00:02:45.135
"I'm leaving your kingdom for a new adventure," Gildong said.

37
00:02:45.136 --> 00:02:49.129
"I'll create a new country with the Hwalbindang, far from here.

38
00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:51.588
Lowborn people will be treated fairly.

39
00:02:51.589 --> 00:02:59.822
They will have the same opportunities as nobles. Good-bye."

40
00:02:59.823 --> 00:03:09.216
Gildong opened his fan, and a fierce wind swirled around the palace.

41
00:03:09.217 --> 00:03:17.198
He soared high into the sky. Thwoosh!

42
00:03:17.199 --> 00:03:22.734
He landed on a large ship.

43
00:03:22.735 --> 00:03:25.176
Chibong hurried over.

44
00:03:25.177 --> 00:03:29.309
"Everything's ready, boss, just as you requested."

45
00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:33.582
"Are we really leaving, little lord?" Nabi asked.

46
00:03:33.583 --> 00:03:38.647
Gildong sighed. "I'm not a lord."

47
00:03:38.648 --> 00:03:43.958
"But you are our boss." Mok laughed.

48
00:03:43.959 --> 00:03:47.154
"Maybe you should be our king!"

49
00:03:47.155 --> 00:03:50.863
Gildong shook his head. "I don't think so.

50
00:03:50.864 --> 00:03:59.091
I only want to do good in the world. Now let's go!"

51
00:03:59.092 --> 00:04:03.730
Everyone sang as the ship took off.

52
00:04:03.731 --> 00:04:06.077
"We'll sail to a new land.

53
00:04:06.078 --> 00:04:08.387
We'll make everything grand.

54
00:04:08.388 --> 00:04:13.723
Thanks to Hong Gildong."

55
00:04:13.724 --> 00:04:17.675
The Hwalbindang sailed beyond the horizon.

56
00:04:17.676 --> 00:04:29.930
And only they know what happened next.

